  (base/rule
   :name "Range"
   :image "images/rule-range.svg"
   :layout base/cardlayout-imageonly
   :summary
    "Short/Medium/Long has a 1-2-4 progression
     * Short: Range:x is the normal effective range of the item/power
     * Medium: Shortx2 Disadvantage
     * Long: Mediumx2 Disadvantage, requires an extra Action and can only be attempted if shooter and target are stationary.
     * [Range:Close] 0m/0ft/Space:0
     * [Range:Melee] 1.5m/5ft/Spaces:1 (Height)
     * [Range:Reach] 3m/10ft/Spaces:2 (Heightx2)
     * [Range:Thrown] 8m/25ft/Spaces:5
     * [Range:Sidearm] 15m/50ft/Spaces:10
     * [Range:Skirmish] 50m/150ft/Spaces:30
     * [Range:Assault] 80m/250ft/Spaces:50
     * [Range:Marksman] 150m/500ft/Spaces:100
     * [Range:Heavy] 300m/1000ft/Spaces:200
     * [Range:Sniper] 500m/1500ft/Spaces:300
     * [Range:Rocket] 1.5km/5000ft/Spaces:1k
     * [Range:Artillery] 5km/3mi/Spaces:3k
     * [Range:Naval] 8km/5mi/Spaces:5k
     * [Range:Orbital] 15km/10mi/Spaces:10k
     * [Range:Ballistic] 150km/100mi/Spaces:100k
     * [Range:Space] 5000km/30000mi")
